chromite: credits

Chromite is a new game after Chromium B.S.U. (2000) by Mark B. Allan: its
rules, enemy behaviours and wave scripts are re-implemented from that game's
source (Clarified Artistic License), and its craft, logo and HUD are
modelled after that game's art. No code, image or sound of the original is
included.

Everything in this game is made by its own code (models in models.c and
logo.c, textures and the reflected environment in textures.c, the fortress
in world.c, the instruments in hud3d.c, colour grades by
tools/make-grade.mjs, particle sprites by tools/make-sprites.mjs, sound and
music by tools/make-audio.mjs), except the fonts:

